              Original (Primary) + copies (Replicas)

Key rule    : Replication ≠ Sharding
              Replication = same data, multiple places
              Sharding    = different data, different places
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
```

