              Partition → ordered log (enables parallelism)
              Offset    → position in partition
              Producer  → writes events to topic
              Consumer  → reads events from topic
              Consumer  → group of consumers sharing load
              Group

vs MQ       : MQ deletes after consume → Kafka retains
              MQ = one consumer → Kafka = many groups
              MQ = thousands/sec → Kafka = millions/sec

