2PC         : Phase 1 = Prepare (vote)
              Phase 2 = Commit or Rollback
              Problem: coordinator SPOF, blocking on crash
              Use: traditional enterprise, XA transactions

SAGA        : Sequence of local transactions
              Each has a compensating transaction
              No distributed locks → available
              Eventual consistency (not ACID)

