              Orchestration → saga controller directs

Compensate  : SAGA rollback = run compensating txns
              in reverse order

Idempotency : Same request called N times = same result
              Critical for retry logic
              Stripe uses idempotency keys

Choose      : 2PC  → small clusters, strict ACID needed
              SAGA → microservices, high availability

Memory      : 2PC = parliament vote (blocking if speaker gone)
              SAGA = build and undo (no single block point)
